sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant AG as agent
  participant SEC as Spring Security
  participant TR as MCP transport (servlet thread)
  participant TOOL as search_runbooks handler
  participant KS as KnowledgeSearch
  AG->>SEC: POST /mcp tools/call · Bearer tool token
  SEC->>SEC: verify signature + exp · require SCOPE_knowledge:read
  SEC->>TR: authenticated request
  TR->>TR: context extractor: principal → tenant_id
  TR->>TOOL: call(transport context, arguments)
  Note right of TOOL: tenant read from the transport context,<br/>never a thread-local (execution may hop threads)
  TOOL->>KS: hybrid search (tenant, query, limit ≤ 8)
  KS-->>TOOL: hits (RLS-bound)
  TOOL-->>AG: one JSON array: docId, title, heading, text
